(docs/BUGS_FOUND.md #99 fixture — the "development copy" half of a local-
shadow pair. Built into the consumer's OWN directory so `see shadow.lib`
(bare, no --lib-path) resolves it against the containing file's directory,
the first step of the search order. `which one` returns 1 here and 2 in
shadow_libpath.vox, so a test can tell which copy actually got linked by
what the consumer prints, not just that it compiled.)

